<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/25/msa@/~cl_6__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan memotong subseksyen (2) dan (3). Penggantian Jadual Keempat"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2008/25/msa@> .
